{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17198","headline":"奉和度支李侍郎早朝 · 权德舆","name":"奉和度支李侍郎早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夙驾趋北阙，晓星啓东方。\n鸣驺分骑吏，列烛散康庄。\n照灼华簪并，逶迤绮陌长。\n腰金初辨色，喷玉自生光。\n献替均三壤，贞明集百祥。\n下才叨接武，空此媿文昌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}